  "description": "B5判・1段組のアルゴリズム解析教科書テーマ。ディスプレイ数式と行番号付き疑似コード、マージナルなサイドノートを組む",
  "keywords": [
    "vivliostyle",
    "vivliostyle-theme"
  ],
  "homepage": "https://github.com/vivliostyle/themes",
  "license": "CC0-1.0",
  "author": "Vivliostyle <mail@vivliostyle.org>",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/vivliostyle/themes.git",
    "directory": "packages/@vivliostyle/theme-pseudocode-math-sidenote"
  },
  "files": [
    "*.css",
    "example",
    "vivliostyle.config.js"
  ],
